            "id": 115263,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que podemos acessar adicionando um terceiro parâmetro opcional à função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O índice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O array de chamada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O índice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma redução precisa do valor na mesma posição em outro array. Qual parâmetro opcional fornece essa posição?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O índice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O array de chamada</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A redução anterior</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher O índice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling .reduce on an Array",
            "id": 115268,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chame a função <code>.reduce()</code> no array <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"84.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>prices</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e finalmente <code>reduce</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
